# Runtime packages of every community-plugins/ port (union of omaxian.deps.json
# "apt"). The plugin trees are seeded into every home and enabled (bar widgets
# on the bar, services in shell.json plugins[]). The PulseAudio speaker
# calibrator is seeded but not enabled: the session is PipeWire, and the two
# calibrators are mutually exclusive.
